// Syncthing ignore — folder "hstar-train" now points at the repo's cases/cases.
// Goal: sync ONLY the train* benchmark cases (live from the repo, no stale copy).
//
// First match wins. Ignore junk/symlinks first, then whitelist train*, then
// ignore everything else (the ~2.5G of non-benchmark cases + their /mnt/share links).

// 1.loa is a case-alias symlink (-> 1.LOA); Windows FS is case-insensitive so
// 1.LOA alone suffices, and syncing the symlink just causes conflicts.
**/1.loa

// stray build/backup artifacts that must never reach Windows
**/.next
**/_stale_legacy_*

// whitelist the benchmark cases (dir + all contents)
!/train*/**
!/train*

// whitelist the architecture diagram (opens in any Windows browser)
!/HSTAR_architecture.html

// whitelist the 2026-08 architecture review reports (~350 KB, docs only).
// Mirrors fem-chat/docs/research/ so the reports are readable on Windows.
// The two .html files open directly in a browser; the rest is Markdown.
!/_review_2026-08/**
!/_review_2026-08

// whitelist the Claude session + research-artifact backup (see its README.md)
!/_claude_backup/**
!/_claude_backup

// ignore all other top-level entries (other cases, loose files, .stfolder marker)
*
